Hi Theresa,
I recall a more recent discussion than the one you linked, that specifically noted what the proper solution would need to be with the system/system2 calls (since the withTimeout method is for pure R code and not standalone calls like the inla program) but I’m not sure what of that got implemented; it would need to use the timeout options you mention, but I haven’t looked in the current code. Do you know in what R version the system() timeout option was introduced?

Finn

